Rule 4 (segment_ids shape must be a prefix of data shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≤ ndim(v_1) ∧ if ndim(v_2) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)
